      "CommitMsg": "fix(cli): sdb release/init/workflow konsisten posisional — tutup 2 bug E2E\n\nTemuan E2E 2026-10-07 (target e2e-ready, jalur penuh init->doctor->gate->workflow->release):\n- BUG #1: `sdb workflow <slug>` menolak target yang baru di-init karena\n  `init_target.py` hanya membuat `evidence/<slug>`, sedangkan runner 16 tahap\n  menuntut `runs/<slug>` + `targets/<slug>`. Fix: init kini membuat\n  runs/<slug>/{docs,logs,reports} dan targets/<slug>/src.\n- BUG #2: `sdb release <slug>` gagal argparse karena hanya mendukung\n  `--project <dir>`. Fix: terima slug POSISIONAL + `--target`, `--project`\n  tetap didukung (kompatibilitas); slug divalidasi fail-closed via\n  validate_slug (CWE-22, exit 2, nol tulisan ke luar repo).\n\nSelaras: Makefile (gate-init/release-check TARGET=), sdb.py (help posisional),\nREADME, GETTING_STARTED, SECURITY_PRIVACY_GATE_0, WORKFLOW_GATES.\n\nBukti:\n- make check EXIT=0: 163 test PASS, skill drift 106/106, lint bersih.\n- E2E segar: init=0 doctor=0 gate=1(FATAL: authorization kosong) workflow=0\n  release=1(FAIL: artefak belum ada). Traversal -> exit 2 tanpa artefak.\n- Test regresi baru 4: posisional==--target (identik), traversal exit 2,\n  --project lama tetap FAIL exit 1; + assertion runs/targets di test_scripts.\n- Pre-Deploy Review §6: secret BERSIH (hits = prosa docs), shuffle BERSIH,\n  dry_run BERSIH, py_compile 5/5 OK.\n- .gitignore: abaikan workspace uji e2e-*/_selftest*/zz-*.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Hermes Anantara v3",
      "Author": "Hermes Super Dev Builders <sdb@localhost>",
      "Committer": "Hermes Super Dev Builders <sdb@localhost>"
    },
